      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "离“橡树大赛”已经没剩几天了。\n我现在只能一心祈祷\n目白多伯重新振作起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "773e42433c55619113d189aeb4dc5a310e7defdc5364fca378d68f015b95acca",
